    {
      "id": "fd5c6449-68ac-482a-ad2f-3be0918035b3",
      "command": "EVENT_IF",
      "args": {
        "condition": {
          "type": "gt",
          "valueA": {
            "type": "variable",
            "value": "44"
          },
          "valueB": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 0
          }
        }
      },
      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "e3db309b-b82d-446b-abc1-5f5e67add2bb",
            "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
            "args": {
              "text": [
                "Slush: My father\nran the east\ngreenhouse. One\nfrozen reply wire,\none",
                "unopened valve,\nand a season of\nseedlings lost.\nThe city sent",
                "condolences\nprinted on very\nwarm paper. I\nbought the lodge\nto stop",
                "waiting for\npermission to keep\npeople safe."
              ],
              "avatarId": "",
              "minHeight": 4,
              "maxHeight": 7,
              "position": "bottom",
              "closeWhen": "key",
              "closeButton": "a"
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "e1f61bf8-9bbd-46aa-abce-ba65339b5fc9",
      "command": "EVENT_IF",
      "args": {
        "condition": {
          "type": "gt",
          "valueA": {
            "type": "variable",
            "value": "44"
          },
          "valueB": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 1
          }
        }
      },
      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "4c8535fe-7971-4f87-a587-105ee3d0220d",
            "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
            "args": {
              "text": [
                "The review file\nhas four fields:\nrepair amount,\nwork date, tenant",
                "name, and medical\nnote. The public\nfund needs the\namount and work",
                "date to verify the\nrepair. Neither a\ntenant name nor a\nmedical note",
                "is needed for that\ncheck. Slush fears\nthe review will\nmake his",
                "residents into\nexhibits. Dot says\naccountability for\nmoney does not",
                "require exposing\ndetails that\ncannot prove how a\nroof was repaired."
              ],
              "avatarId": "",
              "minHeight": 4,
              "maxHeight": 7,
              "position": "bottom",
              "closeWhen": "key",
              "closeButton": "a"
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "00320c7d-bcea-447f-a42c-d4b38dc82107",
      "command": "EVENT_IF",
      "args": {
        "condition": {
          "type": "gt",
          "valueA": {
            "type": "variable",
            "value": "44"
          },
          "valueB": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 2
          }
        }
      },
      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "0674ee36-c1f9-4292-af9e-c244b4ebe6cb",
            "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
            "args": {
              "text": [
                "The survey lists\nactual repair\ncosts, loans, and\ntenants who paid",
                "nothing during the\nfreeze. Beside\nthem is a future\nrent plan for the",
                "sealed district.\nIt would fund\nmaintenance, but\nhalf the current",
                "residents could\nnot afford to\nremain."
              ],
              "avatarId": "",
              "minHeight": 4,
              "maxHeight": 7,
              "position": "bottom",
              "closeWhen": "key",
              "closeButton": "a"
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "e3c96c90-05e8-4ed9-ab07-f8570466362a",
      "command": "EVENT_IF",
      "args": {
        "condition": {
          "type": "gt",
          "valueA": {
            "type": "variable",
            "value": "44"
          },
          "valueB": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 3
          }
        }
      },
      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "7ccfef8a-246c-44a7-a699-55e306c3e9d2",
            "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
            "args": {
              "text": [
                "Slush offers the\nfull inspection\nfile. You may\nREVIEW it together\nat",
                "his desk or\nrequest a PUBLIC\nreview with the\nclerk. Both\npreserve",
                "his private tenant\nnames. Choose the\ntrust process for\nthe",
                "negotiation."
              ],
              "avatarId": "",
              "minHeight": 4,
              "maxHeight": 7,
              "position": "bottom",
              "closeWhen": "key",
              "closeButton": "a"
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "8ef00ff0-8374-4437-a364-434813c68eda",
      "command": "EVENT_IF",
      "args": {
        "condition": {
          "type": "gt",
          "valueA": {
            "type": "variable",
            "value": "44"
          },
          "valueB": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 4
          }
        }
      },
      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "bcaf0c26-375d-4d4d-aaef-53937f4a56cb",
            "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
            "args": {
              "text": [
                "Choose the public\nreview copy: ALL\nincludes every\nfield; COSTS",
                "includes repair\namount AND work\ndate; NAMES\nincludes tenant",
                "identities only.\nWhich copy\nverifies the\nrepair without\nexposing",
                "unrelated private\ndetails? Nib will\ncompare it with\nthe original",
                "before posting.\nSlush waits\nwithout suggesting\nthat privacy\nshould",
                "excuse hiding the\nprice of the work.\nThe same standard\napplies to",
                "either review\nprocess."
              ],
              "avatarId": "",
              "minHeight": 4,
              "maxHeight": 7,
              "position": "bottom",
              "closeWhen": "key",
              "closeButton": "a"
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "8dc324b8-fc68-494e-a8c8-7688fc30835e",
      "command": "EVENT_IF",
      "args": {
        "condition": {
          "type": "gt",
          "valueA": {
            "type": "variable",
            "value": "44"
          },
          "valueB": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 5
          }
        }
      },
      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "5c1cb300-dc14-43ff-a515-18129d020a5f",
            "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
            "args": {
              "text": [
                "Permit note: A\nprivate owner may\nmaintain the\njunction but\ncannot",
                "shut public\nbranches to\nreserve heat for a\nnew estate. Slush\nsigns",
                "beneath it. I know\nwhat the paper\nsays, he tells\nNib. I need to\nknow",
                "the machine will\nagree."
              ],
              "avatarId": "",
              "minHeight": 4,
              "maxHeight": 7,
              "position": "bottom",
              "closeWhen": "key",
              "closeButton": "a"
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    }
  ]
